# Veyran, Voice of Duality: "you casting or copying an instant or sorcery spell" (CR 603.2d, 707.10). Turn 3, after a Mox,
# Bot1 casts Brain Freeze targeting Bot2. Casting it triggers Witherbloom Apprentice's magecraft and Veyran's twice each, and
# its own storm once: storm is an ability of the spell, not of a permanent, so Veyran leaves it alone - five triggers to
# order. Storm copies it once (one spell before it this turn), and that copy triggers both magecraft abilities twice again.
# So Witherbloom drains four times (Bot2 20 -> 16, Bot1 20 -> 24), Veyran gets +4/+4 (a 6/6), and Bot2 mills six (seven cards in its graveyard with the one it discarded to hand size on turn 2).
# Mana: turn 1 Mox Jet and Mox Emerald pay the Apprentice's {B}{G}, Black Lotus (UUU) and the Volcanic Island's {R} pay
# Veyran's {1}{U}{R}; turn 3 Mox Sapphire and the Volcanic Island pay Brain Freeze's {1}{U}.

